{"root":{"data":{"id":"djtba9lw9nk0","created":1783526235819,"text":"数据存储","priority":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbbbk1h3s0","created":1783526318425,"text":"目前架构","layout_mind_offset":{"x":62.83333256261187,"y":-143.16666099015225}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbbute5o80","created":1783526360349,"text":"服务器数据->PlayerController->个体使用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbcnhjnfk0","created":1783526422759,"text":"痛点：PlayerController负责的内容太多太杂，负责RPC大量函数的转接，会有很多的代码干扰，我认为PlayerController应该当作中转站，影响判断，模块化有助于项目的理解"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbjnstcu80","created":1783526971990,"text":"痛点2：个体获取的数据应该共用一块内存，避免各自从云端复制一块独立的内存下来。因此需缓存数据并封装数据获取接口，而在playerController里封装则会导致单个代码文件过大且由于功能多样，容易混淆"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbnm0zztc0","created":1783527281588,"text":"痛点3：目前数据采用一个PlayerData的表存储，过于宽泛"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djtbd60e7w00","created":1783526463081,"text":"优化后的架构","layout_mind_offset":{"x":532.3333031651061,"y":109.58332832074848}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbdckxvc80","created":1783526477384,"text":"服务器数据->PlayerPropertyComponent缓存->个体使用","layout_right_offset":{"x":591.2499823793773,"y":-16.24999951571226}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbirn92qw0","created":1783526901997,"text":"优点：PlayerPropertyComponent只负责数据存储这单一责职。缓存数据，封装数据获取函数，封装数据存储函数，共用一块数据内存，避免数据丢失的情况","layout_right_offset":{"x":1122.499966546894,"y":-7.499999776482582}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbovl55bc0","created":1783527380761,"text":"痛点3优化：对玩家数据进行二级分类：State_Data(用于判断玩家的状态量，如是否登录注册过)","layout_right_offset":{"x":782.4999766796832,"y":24.99999925494194}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbq415vyw0","created":1783527477508,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}